    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life is on the line, survive the entity attempting to murder you in a room where you are nailed down to the bed, unable to walk.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play in a First person point of view, making a more effective jumpscare and experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get the digits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your best to stay alive, and get each number for the randomly generated 5 digit code by completing the television's cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game only requires a keyboard to use the actions of the game with only 6 keys, and a mouse to be able to enter or quit the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAFTEY (READ BEFORE PLAYING)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights which may not be suitable for people with Photosensitive epilepsy.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life is on the line, survive the entity attempting to murder you in a room where you are nailed down to the bed, unable to walk.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play in a First person point of view, making a more effective jumpscare and experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get the digits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your best to stay alive, and get each number for the randomly generated 5 digit code by completing the television's cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game only requires a keyboard to use the actions of the game with only 6 keys, and a mouse to be able to enter or quit the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAFTEY (READ BEFORE PLAYING)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights which may not be suitable for people with Photosensitive epilepsy.</p></li></ul>",
